== Machine Learning Models

Visual feature extraction uses three families of architectures: convolutional neural networks, vision transformers, and multimodal CLIP-based models. Each subsection explains how the architecture works, introduces the specific variants evaluated, and notes their trade-offs for fashion retrieval; the section ends with the model selection decision.

